  </note>
  <note opaque="true" posX="2520" posY="480" sizeHeight="81" sizeWidth="561" text="Improvements:&#xD;&#xA;- Check data types for efficiency &#xD;&#xA;- Should output have the extra column like the original CPEMS file&#xD;&#xA;- Automate the creation of the tables in Snowflake">
