  <note opaque="true" posX="2520" posY="320" sizeHeight="121" sizeWidth="521" text="Hurdles:&#xD;&#xA;- Insert value list does not match column list expecting 17 but got 13&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;- found fix: guess schema and do no change anything&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;- tFlowToIterate could not connect to tSnowflakeRow&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;- found fix: manual iteration">
